# Set up a simple chain of commits and check their log.
> init
<<<
+ wug.txt wug.txt
> add wug.txt
<<<
> commit "added wug"
<<<
D HEADER "commit [a-f0-9]{40}"
D DATE "Date: \w{3} \w{3} \d{2} \d{2}:\d{2}:\d{2} \d{4} [-+]\d{4}"
> log
===
${HEADER}
${DATE}
added wug

===
${HEADER}
${DATE}
initial commit

<<<*
